// 中文维护注释：本文件是 stage799 preview component API state-store commit demo-host preview owner。
// Owner: 消费 stage798 review checkpoint，把 commit admission preview 投射到五类 demo-host surface。
// Truth: 只证明 Todo/settings/AI-generated settings/chat/file browser 可检查同一 admission preview shape。
// Stop-line: 不提交 state-store commit、不发布 visibility、不写 renderer_state/runtime_state。
// Same-shape Boundary Brake: 本 slice 把 per-demo admission preview surface 收束为 stage800 runtime executor 输入。
package cjgui

